# MCPForge — W0-K4. What the image build context must NEVER contain.
#
# The Dockerfile's build stage does `COPY . .`. Without this file that copied
# the developer's runtime state into the image, including secret material:
#   .mcpforge/  — the sealed SecretStore, the portal's private consumer key
#                 (portal/portal-local.private.jwk.json), the mock JDE client
#                 secrets and the runtime database. CLAUDE.md #8: no secret
#                 value may ship in an artefact. Runtime state is mounted as a
#                 volume at run time, never built in.
# and a lot of weight that is rebuilt inside the image anyway.

# Runtime state and secrets — never in an image.
.mcpforge/
**/.mcpforge/
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.jwk.json

# Rebuilt inside the image.
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.vite/
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/

# Not needed to build or run.
.git/
.forge-build/
*.zip
*.7z
